<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African confidence index highest since October.</title>
<headline>S.African confidence index highest since October.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Chamber of Business said its business confidence index for December and January combined (1990 = 100) rose by one percentage points to 112.3points from 111.3 points in November and 119.2 a year ago.</p>
<p>The reading was the highest since October 1996, when it stood at 114.3.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
